5: /* ==========================================================================
6:    Vendored pixel display face: Silkscreen by Jason Kottke, SIL Open Font
7:    License 1.1, latin subset, served from src/assets/fonts so the booth
8:    machine still never reaches the network. It is chrome only: the station
9:    title, eyebrows, band names, and button caps. Every number the engine
10:    prints stays on the tabular mono stack, because a scoreboard font must
11:    never change how a digit lines up.
12:    ========================================================================== */
13: 
14: @font-face {
15:   font-family: 'Silkscreen';
16:   font-style: normal;
17:   font-weight: 400;
18:   font-display: swap;
19:   src: url('./assets/fonts/silkscreen-400.woff2') format('woff2');
